<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</title>
<headline>ROMANIAN SHIPPING - DRY CARGO, CONSTANTA PORT.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were</p>
<p>loading, discharging in the Black Sea port of Constanta on</p>
<p>Wednesday, port authorities said.</p>
<p>   SHIP		     COMMODITY    OPERATION   TONNES</p>
<p> - Verona		   raw sugar	dsg	 14,000</p>
<p> - Maramures		phosphate	dsg	 18,312</p>
<p> - Sammarina 5	    urea	     ldg	  7,500</p>
<p> - M. Melody		fertilisers    ldg	 14,500</p>
<p> - Majestic		 gen goods	ldg	 12,000</p>
<p> - Seven Seas	     fertilisers    ldg	  6,000</p>
<p> - Yehia A.		 nitrate	  ldg	  5,250</p>
<p> - Europegasus	    soy bean	 dsg	 24,113</p>
<p> - Agnita		   cement	   ldg	 11,500</p>
<p> - Dede C		   fertilisers    ldg	  4,500</p>
<p> - Abdul Razzak	   alumina	  dsg	 10,500</p>
<p> - Terpsichore	    urea	     ldg	 22,000</p>
<p> - Leros Spirit	   manganese ore  dsg	 25,838</p>
<p> - Innovator		iron ore	 dsg	143,324</p>
<p> - Olivia		   iron ore	 dsg	147,350</p>
